    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, plotting the diagram of the above expression we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0038_7ff5340ed452.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 228px;\"/></p><p>Now, from above diagram we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>41</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"